; Sylara — Wind Ranger rig (logika Godot native, 100% render kode):
;   SylaraSkeleton (root: state machine + blending + drive API + sinyal)
;   ├── Renderer  — _draw() prosedural berlapis, bidik 360° (SylaraRenderer.gd)
;   ├── SkillFX   — sequencer FX skill via sinyal + VFXManager pooled
;   └── Feel      — audio/shake/hit-stop, event-driven (SylaraCombatFeel.gd)
; Animasi: SylaraAnimator.gd (pose target per state, tulis pakai-ulang).
; Satu CanvasItem per karakter — ringan di Android.
; Flip facing dilakukan PARENT (Hero/Visual); rig digambar menghadap +x.
; Gameplay (damage/cooldown/kit) milik HeroSkillKit — rig ini murni
; visual + feel dan hanya MEMBACA state hero (read-only).

